        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This updates <code class="notranslate">WorkerGlobalScope.setInterval()</code> for trusted types.</p>
